<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITION FIXTURES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITION FIXTURES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following matches are being</p>
<p>played in the three European club competitions this week (GMT</p>
<p>kickoff time precedes fixture, first leg scores in parentheses):</p>
<p>Tuesday, October 29</p>
<p>UEFA Cup second round, second legs</p>
<p>1400 Spartak Moscow (Russia) v Hamburg (Germany) (0-3)</p>
<p>1645 Trabzonspor (Turkey) v Schalke (Germany) (0-1)</p>
<p>1800 Casino Graz (Austria) v Internazionale (Italy) (0-1)</p>
<p>1800 Sporting Lisbon (Portugal) v Metz (France) (0-2)</p>
<p>1830 Monaco (France) v Bor.Moenchengladbach (Germany) (4-2)</p>
<p>1900 Besiktas (Turkey) v Legia Warsaw (Poland) (1-1)</p>
<p>1900 Neuchatel Xamax (Switz) v Helsingborg (Sweden) (0-2)</p>
<p>1900 National Bucharest (Rom) v Club Brugge (Belgium) (0-2)</p>
<p>1910 Brondby (Denmark) v Aberdeen (Scotland) (2-0)</p>
<p>1930 Anderlecht (Belgium) v Vitoria Guimaraes (Port) (1-1)</p>
<p>1930 Feyenoord (Netherlands) v Espanyol (Spain) (3-0)</p>
<p>1945 Roma (Italy) v Karlsruhe (Germany) (0-3)</p>
<p>2000 Newcastle U(England) v Ferencvaros (Hungary) (2-3)</p>
<p>2030 Boavista (Portugal) v Dynamo Tbilisi (Georgia) (0-1)</p>
<p>2030 Tenerife (Spain) v Lazio (Italy) (0-1)</p>
<p>2100 Valencia (Spain) v Slavia Prague (Czech Republic) (1-0)</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>Wednesday, October 30</p>
<p>European Champions' League (all kickoff times 1930 gmt)</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Glasgow Rangers (Scotland) v Ajax (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Grasshopper Zurich (Switzerland) v Auxerre (France)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>Widzew Lodz (Poland) v Steaua Bucharest (Romania)</p>
<p>Borussia Dortmund (Germany) v Atletico Madrid (Spain)</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>Manchester United (England) v Fenerbahce (Turkey)</p>
<p>Juventus (Italy) v Rapid Vienna (Austria)</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>Porto (Portugal) v Rosenborg Trondheim (Norway)</p>
<p>AC Milan (Italy) v IFK Gothenburg (Sweden)</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>Thursday, October 31</p>
<p>European Cup Winners's Cup second round, second legs </p>
<p>1600 AEK Athens v Olimpija Ljubljana (Slovenia) (2-0)</p>
<p>1700 AIK Stockholm (Sweden) v Nimes (France) (3-1)</p>
<p>1800 Lokomotiv Moscow (Russia) v Benfica (Portugal) (0-1)</p>
<p>1845 Paris St Germain v Galatasaray (Turkey) (2-4)</p>
<p>1930 PSV Eindhoven (Neth) v Brann Bergen (Norway) (1-2)</p>
<p>1945 Red Star Belgrade (Yugoslavia) v Barcelona (1-3)</p>
<p>1945 Sparta Prague (Czech Rep) v Fiorentina (Italy) (1-2)</p>
<p>1945 Liverpool (England) v Sion (Switzerland) (2-1)</p>
